      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 854: 🟡 Removing the account only disables future synchronization; queued and in-flight entries in the process-wide `attachmentDownloads` queue, plus their suppression markers, are retained. The pump can therefore continue calling `downloadFile` for an account that was deleted and may write stale imported files if the account ID is reused. Purge this account\u0027s queued/in-flight work and related file IDs during removal.",
      "revId": "c9bf53ebe1317b46ac647d2b4abcf51ccb54f0e6",
