      "message": "[error] Line 579: 🔴 This only clears `syncedAttachmentFileIds` for `TRANSFER_FINISHED`, but `TransferStatus.isOver` also includes cancellation, timeout, and other error states. Those terminal events are suppressed here and leave the file ID in the set forever, so later events for the same transfer remain hidden and the set leaks. Clear the suppression marker for every terminal status (or use the same `isOver` predicate used by `AccountService`).",
